  /// - `bypass`: skip the result cache. Null writes an empty argument.
  T bc(bool? bypass) => option('bc', [bypass]);

  /// Tags for the Cache-Tag response header.
  ///
  /// URL names: `cache_tags`, `ct`; arguments `tags… (visible ASCII, no commas; replaces earlier tags)`; default —. Milestone M2 (WP-34b, WP-64 end-to-end test); scope request. imgproxy Pro option (free here).
  ///
  /// - `tags`: Repeated argument: `tag`: visible ASCII without commas; a single empty tag clears. Null writes an empty argument.
  T cacheTags(List<String> tags) => option('cache_tags', [...tags]);

  /// Tags for the Cache-Tag response header.
  ///
  /// URL names: `cache_tags`, `ct`; arguments `tags… (visible ASCII, no commas; replaces earlier tags)`; default —. Milestone M2 (WP-34b, WP-64 end-to-end test); scope request. imgproxy Pro option (free here).
  ///
  /// - `tags`: Repeated argument: `tag`: visible ASCII without commas; a single empty tag clears. Null writes an empty argument.
